      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 38,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 3
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Synthetic fixture, observed 17 November 2026 at 10:00 UTC. These are not live production service metrics.**\n\nEqual 20-minute windows: 09:20–09:40 and 09:40–10:00 UTC. Error rates and latency are supplied by the fixture. Finding counts update only after the canonical triage workflow succeeds; custom scripts cannot publish findings."
      }
